acking their town. Use common yard tools such as Weed Wackers, Lawn Mowers, and Axes to fight off dozens of weeds all while being forced to perform mundane work tasks by their boss.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George and Ken are working a normal, 90 degree workday at their summer job, when suddenly the weeds surrounding them come to life and begin to attack them, draining all of the water and moisture from their body as they are hit. The boys quickly learn to fight off the weeds using their tools with the help of their mentors and coworkers, Jimbo and Hughbert, and begin to fend off onslaughts of weeds created by the evil god Viridian.\u00a0George and Ken face multiple types of common garden weeds at different locations in their town, all while trying to set up and prepare for the towns annual 4th of July summer festival, and facing the expectations of their boss and mayor of the town, V.V.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a story filled with fun jokes, cheesy one liners, and unexpected twists and turns when you least expect it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725220/extras/4615fe831d783773f7417890a06b3236.avif?t=1767014495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725220/extras_big/4615fe831d783773f7417890a06b3236.avif?t=1767014495 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725220/extras/a3b86ca4274dc3724172f3333aceb809.avif?t=1767014495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725220/extras_big/a3b86ca4274dc3724172f3333aceb809.avif?t=1767014495 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_