ultiplayer. By plugging in 2 controllers and enabling the state of the art &quot;Little Sibling Mode&quot; you no longer have to give them an unplugged controller! A second player can join in as the following character and provide support to player one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725220/extras/651afa28d82fd2a053966d84d9bc7f03.avif?t=1767014495\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725220/extras_big/651afa28d82fd2a053966d84d9bc7f03.avif?t=1767014495 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Station City Studio"],"dlc":[3755270],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725220/109ce7d9ee29c95569fe763661acf9e4fe371644/header.jpg?t=1767014495","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Weed Wacker Warrior is purely a work of fiction. Any Similarities to real brands or individuals is purely coincidental or inspirational.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3725220/1533528018/1c4a0bc79c4b2c79043a62bc5b5b30a9a34cb17a/1760066432/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760066984","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3725220/1533528018/1c4a0bc79c4b2c79043a62bc5b5b30a9a34cb17a/1760066432/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760066984","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3